tags: device-models

A fact of a start: the model of each device that the node attached to the instance at
this start.

The value is key=value lines, sorted by the bytes of the key, separated by a newline.
The key is the position of the entry of Container.devices, in base 10. The value is the
model: "pci:" and the value of the fact pci-model (0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:5d2ce65a6fa1e2a557a53196d610878b547bc1bc87ab8e63a7cabf5fd85caff1), or "usb:"
and the value of the fact usb-model (0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:00fec13f609faabea95d819413049d3f2a92abfe46e4fc5298a66b5400d498f5). Example:
0=pci:10de:2330. An entry with no device at the start has no line.

An absent fact: the node attests no model. The node is bound: it signs the receipt.

=== formal
class=fact
name=device-models
pci=0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:5d2ce65a6fa1e2a557a53196d610878b547bc1bc87ab8e63a7cabf5fd85caff1
place=StartReceipt.facts
usb=0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:00fec13f609faabea95d819413049d3f2a92abfe46e4fc5298a66b5400d498f5
value=key=value lines sorted by key; the key is the position of the entry of Container.devices in base 10; the value is pci:<value of the fact pci-model> or usb:<value of the fact usb-model>
